==================METHODS=========================================

accessModifier[public/private/protected] returnType[void/dataType] methodName(can/t parameters)
{
   action over variables
}


==============================
Understand the problem
Create a class
identify what to store - variables
define the purpose of storing the variables - methods
 accessModifier[public/private/protected] returnType[void/dataType] methodName(can/t parameters)
 {
    action over variables
 }
now the above one is template [class]

to use this template, we have to create the copy[object]--> create a class with main method
create the copy[object] of the class you want to use using below syntax inside main method
 NameOfTheCLassWhoseCopyYouWantToCreate nameOfCopy = new NameOfTheClassWhoseCopyYouWantToCreate();
Assign value to variables using object name;
Call the method using object name;

Run your program
